  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"MainContent\" role=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\"> <section id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__main\"><product-info id=\"MainProduct-template--28395229741431__main\" data-section=\"template--28395229741431__main\" data-product-id=\"15499088167287\" data-update-url=\"true\" data-url=\"/products/jolla-phone-october-2026\"> </product-info> </section><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__custom_liquid_BTWV9m\"> <div> <p>Jolla Phone · Production batches</p> <h2>Cumulative volume, batch by batch</h2> <p>Plotted by the date each batch closed. The running total passes 10,000 units secured at Batch&nbsp;#3.</p> </div> <p><span><i></i>Cumulative volume</span> <span><i></i>Batch closed</span> </p> </div><section id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__featured_product_fCgNqM\"><product-info data-section=\"template--28395229741431__featured_product_fCgNqM\" data-product-id=\"15428110844279\" data-update-url=\"false\" data-url=\"/products/jolla-phone-back-cover\"> </product-info> </section><section id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__featured_product_AfcgmA\"><product-info data-section=\"template--28395229741431__featured_product_AfcgmA\" data-product-id=\"15428565631351\" data-update-url=\"false\" data-url=\"/products/jolla-phone-screen-protector\"> </product-info> </section><section id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__featured_product_fkBRBJ\"><product-info data-section=\"template--28395229741431__featured_product_fkBRBJ\" data-product-id=\"15428857594231\" data-update-url=\"false\" data-url=\"/products/jolla-phone-protective-cover\"> </product-info> </section><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__image_with_text_8rded9\"> <div> <p><img src=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/toh_wire_2.png?v=1765623484&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/toh_wire_2.png?v=1765623484&amp;width=165 165w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/toh_wire_2.png?v=1765623484&amp;width=360 360w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/toh_wire_2.png?v=1765623484&amp;width=535 535w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/toh_wire_2.png?v=1765623484&amp;width=750 750w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/toh_wire_2.png?v=1765623484&amp;width=1070 1070w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/toh_wire_2.png?v=1765623484&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 550px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) / 2), calc((100vw - 50px) / 2)\" fetchpriority=\"auto\">\n</p> </div> <div id=\"ImageWithText--template--28395229741431__image_with_text_8rded9\"><h2> The Other Half Returns </h2><div><p>We are bringing back the iconic The Other Half open innovation platform and smart covers!</p><p>Help us design the first modules, and vote on features. Join the <a href=\"https://forum.sailfishos.org/t/the-other-half-returns-community-innovation-program/26011\"><span>innovation program</span></a> today.</p></div><p><a href=\"https://forum.sailfishos.org/t/the-other-half-returns-community-innovation-program/26011\"> Join In </a></p></div> </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__image_with_text_TKWiXL\"> <div> <p><img src=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/9_21e0f8e5-5962-4c53-9500-8b269a50313b.png?v=1774602114&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/9_21e0f8e5-5962-4c53-9500-8b269a50313b.png?v=1774602114&amp;width=165 165w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/9_21e0f8e5-5962-4c53-9500-8b269a50313b.png?v=1774602114&amp;width=360 360w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/9_21e0f8e5-5962-4c53-9500-8b269a50313b.png?v=1774602114&amp;width=535 535w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/9_21e0f8e5-5962-4c53-9500-8b269a50313b.png?v=1774602114&amp;width=750 750w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/9_21e0f8e5-5962-4c53-9500-8b269a50313b.png?v=1774602114&amp;width=1070 1070w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/9_21e0f8e5-5962-4c53-9500-8b269a50313b.png?v=1774602114&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 550px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) / 2), calc((100vw - 50px) / 2)\" fetchpriority=\"auto\">\n</p> </div> <div id=\"ImageWithText--template--28395229741431__image_with_text_TKWiXL\"><h2> Jolla Phone accessories </h2><div> <p>Spare batteries and other accessories will be made available closer to the shipping.</p><p><span>Estimated opening June 2026</span></p> </div></div> </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__image_with_text_4CUjhx\"> <div> <p><img src=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/Snow_White_production.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/Snow_White_production.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=165 165w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/Snow_White_production.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=360 360w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/Snow_White_production.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=535 535w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/Snow_White_production.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=750 750w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/Snow_White_production.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=1070 1070w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/Snow_White_production.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1300\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 550px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) / 2), calc((100vw - 50px) / 2)\" fetchpriority=\"auto\">\n</p> </div> <div id=\"ImageWithText--template--28395229741431__image_with_text_4CUjhx\"><h2> <strong>Performance Meets Privacy</strong> </h2><div> <ul><li>5G with dual nano-SIM</li><li>Storage expandable up to 2TB with memory card</li><li>Sailfish OS 5</li><li>Support for Android apps with Jolla AppSupport</li><li>User replaceable back cover with colour options</li><li>User replaceable battery</li><li>Physical Privacy Switch</li></ul> </div></div> </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__image_with_text_L7t8yB\"> <div> <p><img src=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/original_jolla_design.png?v=1764921121&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/original_jolla_design.png?v=1764921121&amp;width=165 165w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/original_jolla_design.png?v=1764921121&amp;width=360 360w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/original_jolla_design.png?v=1764921121&amp;width=535 535w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/original_jolla_design.png?v=1764921121&amp;width=750 750w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/original_jolla_design.png?v=1764921121&amp;width=1070 1070w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/original_jolla_design.png?v=1764921121&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 550px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) / 2), calc((100vw - 50px) / 2)\" fetchpriority=\"auto\">\n</p> </div> <div id=\"ImageWithText--template--28395229741431__image_with_text_L7t8yB\"><h2> Privacy by Design </h2><div> <ul><li>No tracking, no calling home, no hidden analytics</li><li>User configurable physical Privacy Switch - turn off your microphone, bluetooth, Android apps, or whatever you wish</li></ul> </div></div> </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__image_with_text_mmXzb3\"> <div> <p><img src=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/sideways.png?v=1764930943&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/sideways.png?v=1764930943&amp;width=165 165w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/sideways.png?v=1764930943&amp;width=360 360w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/sideways.png?v=1764930943&amp;width=535 535w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/sideways.png?v=1764930943&amp;width=750 750w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/sideways.png?v=1764930943&amp;width=1070 1070w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/sideways.png?v=1764930943&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 550px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) / 2), calc((100vw - 50px) / 2)\" fetchpriority=\"auto\">\n</p> </div> <div id=\"ImageWithText--template--28395229741431__image_with_text_mmXzb3\"><h2> Scandinavian styling in its pure form </h2><div> <ul><li>Honouring the original Jolla Phone form factor and design</li><li>Replaceable back cover</li><li>Available in three distinct colours inspired by Nordic nature</li></ul> </div></div> </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__image_with_text_hpXzW6\"> <div> <p><img src=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/color_options.png?v=1764920588&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/color_options.png?v=1764920588&amp;width=165 165w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/color_options.png?v=1764920588&amp;width=360 360w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/color_options.png?v=1764920588&amp;width=535 535w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/color_options.png?v=1764920588&amp;width=750 750w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/color_options.png?v=1764920588&amp;width=1070 1070w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/color_options.png?v=1764920588&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 550px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) / 2), calc((100vw - 50px) / 2)\" fetchpriority=\"auto\">\n</p> </div> <div id=\"ImageWithText--template--28395229741431__image_with_text_hpXzW6\"><h2> Available in distinct user replaceable colours </h2><div> <ul><li>Snow White</li><li>Kaamos Black</li><li>The Orange</li></ul> </div><p> Choose one or more </p></div> </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__rich_text_NFgR3m\"><h2 data-cascade=\"\"> <strong>An Independent Linux Phone</strong> </h2><div data-cascade=\"\"> <p>A successor to the iconic original Jolla Phone from 2013, brought to 2026 with modern specs and honoring the Jolla heritage design.</p><p>A phone you can actually daily-drive. Still Private. Still Yours.</p> </div></div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__rich_text_FkDxbM\"><h2 data-cascade=\"\"> <strong>Defined together with the Community</strong> </h2><div data-cascade=\"\"> <p>Sailfish OS community members <a href=\"https://forum.sailfishos.org/t/next-gen-jolla-phone/23882\"><span>voted</span></a> on what the next Jolla device should be. The key characteristics, specifications and features of the device. </p><p><em>Based on community voting and real user needs, this device has only one mission:</em></p><p><strong>Put control back in your hands.</strong></p> </div></div><section id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__slideshow_wwtafn\"> <slideshow-component role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"Carousel\" aria-label=\"Slideshow about our brand\"></slideshow-component>\n</section><div data-cascade=\"\" id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__multicolumn_cyDMjU\"><slider-component> <ul id=\"Slider-template--28395229741431__multicolumn_cyDMjU\" role=\"list\"><li id=\"Slide-template--28395229741431__multicolumn_cyDMjU-1\" data-cascade=\"\"> <div><h3><strong>Built for Longevity</strong></h3><p>Sailfish OS is proven to outlive mainstream support cycles. Long-term OS support, guaranteed for minimum 5 years. Incremental updates, and no forced obsolescence.</p></div> </li><li id=\"Slide-template--28395229741431__multicolumn_cyDMjU-2\" data-cascade=\"\"> <div><h3><strong>Your Phone Shouldn’t Spy on You</strong></h3><div><p>Mainstream phones send vast amounts of background data. A common Android phone sends megabytes of data per day to Google even if the device is not used at all.</p><p>Sailfish OS stays silent unless you explicitly allow connections.</p></div></div> </li></ul></slider-component> </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__image_with_text_MMf8FF\"> <div> <p><img src=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/JP26_lifestyle.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/JP26_lifestyle.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=165 165w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/JP26_lifestyle.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=360 360w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/JP26_lifestyle.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=535 535w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/JP26_lifestyle.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=750 750w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/JP26_lifestyle.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=1070 1070w, https://commerce.jolla.com/cdn/shop/files/JP26_lifestyle.png?v=1775128017&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 550px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) / 2), calc((100vw - 50px) / 2)\" fetchpriority=\"auto\">\n</p> </div> <div id=\"ImageWithText--template--28395229741431__image_with_text_MMf8FF\"><p> DIT: DO IT TOGETHER </p><h2> <strong>This isn’t your regular smartphone project.</strong> </h2><div> <p><strong>It’s a community mission.</strong></p><ul><li>You voted on the device</li><li>You guided its specs and definition</li><li>You shaped the philosophy</li><li>And now you help bring it to life</li></ul> </div><p><a href=\"https://forum.sailfishos.org/\"> Our Community </a></p></div> </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_yiTUTp\"> <p> <h2 id=\"techspecs\"> TECH SPECS </h2> </p> <div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_H4NULg-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_yiTUTp\" open=\"\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_H4NULg-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_yiTUTp\"> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <div id=\"CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_H4NULg-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_yiTUTp\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"Summary-collapsible_row_H4NULg-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_yiTUTp\"> <ul><li>SoC: Mediatek Dimensity 7100 5G platform</li><li>Memory: 8GB/128GB and 12GB/256GB memory configurations</li><li>Storage expandable up to 2TB with microSDXC memory card</li><li>Cellular: 4G + 5G with single tray two-sided dual nano-SIM with a separate slot for the microSDXC</li><li>Display: 6.36” ~390ppi FullHD AMOLED, aspect ratio 20:9, Gorilla Glass</li><li>Sony cameras: 50MP wide + 13MP ultrawide main cameras, front facing 32MP wide-lens selfie camera</li><li>Battery: 5450mAh, user replaceable</li><li>Connectivity: WiFi 6, BT 5.4, NFC</li><li>Location: GPS/Galileo/GLONASS/BEIDOU</li><li>Dimensions: ~158 x 74 x 9mm, est. 190g</li><li>Other: Power key fingerprint reader, user changeable backcover, RGB indication LED, Privacy Switch</li><li>Assembly: Finland</li></ul><p>4G &amp; 5G global roaming modem configuration:<br></p><ul><li>LTE FDD: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 12, 17, 18, 19, 20, 25, 26, 28AB, 66</li><li>LTE TDD: 34, 38, 39, 40, 41</li><li>5G NR: n1, n2, n3, n5, n7, n8, n12, n20, n26, n28, n38, n40, n41, n66, n77, n78</li></ul><p>Technical specification subject to final confirmation upon final payment and manufacturing. Minor alterations may apply. </p> </div> </details> </div> </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <p> <h2 id=\"faq\"> FAQ </h2> </p> <div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_Xg7HPj-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_Xg7HPj-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> Why a batch sales model? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <div id=\"CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_Xg7HPj-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"Summary-collapsible_row_Xg7HPj-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <p>We source components and produce in limited batches.</p><p>Further,&nbsp; the memory component prices and availability have been exceptionally volatile over the past <a href=\"https://counterpointresearch.com/en/insights/memory-price-tracker-january-2026\"><span>quarters</span></a> and the <a href=\"https://www.idc.com/resource-center/blog/higher-asps-lower-unit-volumes-how-the-memory-crisis-is-reshaping-the-pc-and-smartphone-outlook/\"><span>forecasts</span></a> remain such for the whole 2026. This is precisely why we structured our pre-orders in limited batches with locked prices, so we could plan component procurement and honour the price we committed to you.</p> </div> </details> </div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_7Rpcbi-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_7Rpcbi-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> Is the purchase refundable? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <div id=\"CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_7Rpcbi-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"Summary-collapsible_row_7Rpcbi-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <p>Yes. Fully.</p><p>We refund all payments upon request. While making a request please note to detail your order number and proof of payment.</p><p>For the time being our refund process is manual and it will take some time to process your request. Rest assured, you will get your money back if you have requested. 100% guarantee.</p> </div> </details> </div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_BajF7m-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_BajF7m-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> What changed between batches? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <div id=\"CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_BajF7m-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"Summary-collapsible_row_BajF7m-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <p>Pre-order batches #1, #2, #3, and the first 1000 and second 2000 units of the Sep 2026 are now locked.</p><ul><li>Pre-order batches #1, #2 and #3 <strong>ALL</strong> ship with 12GB RAM and 256GB storage</li><li>Sep 2026 ships with 8GB RAM and 256GB storage unless you upgraded to 12/256GB configuration (<a href=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/products/jolla-phone-12gb-memory-upgrade\" title=\"12GB RAM upgrade\">upgrade still available</a>)</li><li>Sep-II 2026 ships with 8GB RAM and 128GB storage (<a href=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/products/memory-and-storage-upgrade\" title=\"12GB RAM / 256GB storage upgrade option\">12/256GB upgrade option</a>)</li></ul><p>All orders include a refundable 99€ down payment, deducted from your final payment.</p> </div> </details> </div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_aNBNkP-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_aNBNkP-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> What is the memory configuration of my batch? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <div id=\"CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_aNBNkP-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"Summary-collapsible_row_aNBNkP-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <p>Memory component prices and availability have had exceptionally high volatility in past quarters. Thus, we plan memory configurations and sell in limited batches to manage working capital.</p><ul><li>Pre-order batches #1, #2 and #3 <strong>ALL</strong> ship with 12GB RAM and 256GB storage</li><li>Sep 2026 ships with 8GB RAM and 256GB storage unless you upgraded to 12/256GB configuration (<a href=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/products/jolla-phone-12gb-memory-upgrade\" title=\"12GB RAM upgrade\">upgrade still available</a>)</li><li>Sep-II 2026 ships with 8GB RAM and 128GB storage (<a href=\"https://commerce.jolla.com/products/memory-and-storage-upgrade\" title=\"12GB RAM / 256GB storage upgrade option\">12/256GB upgrade option</a>)</li></ul> </div> </details> </div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_mPxbE9-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_mPxbE9-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> What is the normal price of the product, do I get discount by ordering now? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <div id=\"CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_mPxbE9-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"Summary-collapsible_row_mPxbE9-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <p>By ordering now you secure your total final price of 649€ (incl. your local VAT).</p><p>Notably in particular memory component prices and availability have had exceptionally high volatility in past quarters. Thus, we sell in limited batches so we can plan memory configurations and manage working capital.</p> </div> </details> </div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_VxbBNb-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_VxbBNb-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> Can I cancel anytime? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <div id=\"CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_VxbBNb-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"Summary-collapsible_row_VxbBNb-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <p>Yes.</p><p>We refund all payments upon request. While making a request please note to detail your order number and proof of payment.</p><p>For the time being our refund process is manual and it will take some time to process your request. Rest assured, you will get your money back if you have requested. 100% guarantee.</p> </div> </details> </div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_LBEdCJ-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_LBEdCJ-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> Is this phone real or just a concept? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <p>It is real. We successfully completed the pre-order phase and secured the product program. Please join and follow the progress <a href=\"https://forum.sailfishos.org/t/jolla-phone-update-lights-on-technical-bits-and-the-schedule/27821\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Lights on, technical bits and the schedule\">in the forum</a>.</p> </details> </div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_9fKqjL-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_9fKqjL-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> Will there be accessories, like a spare battery and protective case? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <p>Yes, there is and further is coming -- stay tuned.</p> </details> </div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_hYBf7e-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_hYBf7e-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> When will the first Jolla Phones ship? When I get mine? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <div id=\"CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_hYBf7e-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"Summary-collapsible_row_hYBf7e-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <p>We start shipping the batch #1 in beginning of July 2026, followed by pre-order batches #2 and #3 during July-August.</p><p>The Sep 2026 and Sep-II 2026 batches will both ship in September 2026 (in this order).</p> </div> </details> </div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_HXEkE6-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_HXEkE6-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> Will the Jolla Phone work outside Europe, can I use it e.g. in the U.S.? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <p>Yes, we have designed the cellular band configuration to enable global traveling as much as possible, including e.g. roaming in the U.S. carrier networks. </p> </details> </div><div> <details id=\"Details-collapsible_row_WbwtM4-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <summary id=\"Summary-collapsible_row_WbwtM4-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <h3> Can I buy the Jolla Phone if I’m outside Europe, can I use it e.g. in the U.S.? </h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 6\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M9.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>\n</summary> <div id=\"CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_WbwtM4-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"Summary-collapsible_row_WbwtM4-template--28395229741431__collapsible_content_VV7zwn\"> <p>The initial sales markets are EU, UK, Switzerland and Norway. Entering other markets, such as the U.S. and Canada are to be decided due course based on potential interest from the areas.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>We have designed the cellular band configuration to enable potential future markets, including major U.S. carrier networks.&nbsp; </p> </div> </details> </div></div> </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--28395229741431__featured_collection_UPrKqy\" data-id=\"template--28395229741431__featured_collection_UPrKqy\"> <p><h2> You may also like </h2></p> <slider-component> <ul id=\"Slider-template--28395229741431__featured_collection_UPrKqy\" data-id=\"template--28395229741431__featured_collection_UPrKqy\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Slider\"> <li id=\"Slide-template--28395229741431__featured_collection_UPrKqy-1\" data-cascade=\"\"> </li></ul></slider-component></div> </div></div>",
